data: {"id": "cf0e0e885ea24eca-thinking-parallel_evidence-844", "run_id": "cf0e0e885ea24eca", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实（与候选原因的对位）\n\n- **Pod 身份与生命周期**\n  - namespace/pod/UID: `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` / `3f9c97a0-dee7-484f-90ee-dcce79c0b28b`\n  - 调度到 `node2`；`phase: Pending`；`containerStatuses.app.reason=ContainerCreating`；`restarts=0`。\n  - **Metrics 一致**：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1`（reason=ContainerCreating）；`kube_pod_status_phase=Pending=1`；无 Running/Succeeded/Failed 活跃值。\n\n- **Events 原文指向的 Direct Cause**\n  - 事件包含反复的 `NoNetworkFound` 与 `FailedCreatePodSandBox`。\n  - 错误原文关键句：`c", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788780086162, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

