data: {"id": "cf0e0e885ea24eca-final", "run_id": "cf0e0e885ea24eca", "seq": 849, "ts_ms": 1788780101909, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx stuck in Pending/ContainerCreating |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `ContainerCreating` | 确认应用容器持续处于等待状态，Pod 无法进入 Running。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Multus | `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 核心故障证据：多路复用 CNI (Multus) 在初始化阶段无法定位网络资源。 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubelet | `Failed to create pod sandbox... failed to setup network for sandbox... Multus... failed getting the delegate...` | 底层失败机制：由于网络依赖未满足，容器运行时 (Container Runtime) 无法创建 Pod 沙箱。 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 指标层面证实了 Pod 持续卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态，未随时间恢复。 |\n\n**证据关联：**\n- 证据 1 和 4 互为表里，从 Pod 状态和监控指标两方面锁定了“卡死”现象。\n- 证据 2 与 3 形成因果闭环：Kubelet 报错（证据 3）直接由 Multus 报找不到指定网络定义（证据 2）导致。由于日志/追踪不可用，此 Kubernetes 层面证据为决定性证据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 引用不存在的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition → Multus CNI 无法解析网络资源 → 容器运行时创建 Pod Sandbox 失败 → Pod 持续停留在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**`aiops-case-05` 命名空间内引用了不存在的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` (“unavailable-network”)。**\n\nPod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 的 Spec 中声明了 Multus CNI 网络附件，但在该命名空间中实际缺少名为 `unavailable-network` 的定义资源（见证据 #2）。这导致 Multus 插件在初始化阶段报错，进而触发 kubelet 的 `FailedCreatePodSandBox`（见证据 #3），最终使 Pod 无法启动并保持 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见证据 #1, #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 43.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 43.3s (Evidence 36.5s, RCA 6.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 66.224, "metrics": {"run_id": "cf0e0e885ea24eca", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 66.22906446456909, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 66229.06446456909, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 56121.44684791565, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls":